{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcStory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In 2010, 1% of the world's population possesses paranormal abilities. Dr. Scaler, who possesses the power of immortality, engages in brutal human experiments to research paranormal abilities. He does so without hesitation or fear. There's only one thing that scares this man: the never-ending nightmare of dental treatment. Scalar, who is so dedicated to thorough dental care, could never have predicted that this nightmare would become reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/972603328245fc2935375b7f658134fc.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcSimple Exploration System x Psychological Horror Themed on Dental Treatment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game features a simple 2D exploration system, with basic controls limited to movement and investigation (talking). Players control Dr. Scaler, exploring both the real world and the spiritual world to unravel the mysteries that plague his psyche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/de6c83e39c42ae23cfe6d702e5b521ff.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcMultiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story has three endings depending on the choices you make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Scaler possesses superhuman strength, yet his only weakness is dental work. Every choice he makes leads him on a journey to discover who he is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/109287f3e3fa089581179671f9f7bb4b.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bc Mysterious Characters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, he's not the only one with supernatural abilities. Even his trustworthy dentist likely harbors terrifying powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/bf95d09e4d74a3e8994515fefc583a38.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will his choices save humanity or doom him? Watch as Dr. Scaler and humanity face their own fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCompletion Time: Approximately 3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCollect all endings: Approximately 3-5 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbScenario-driven exploration adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSimple and classic exploration system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPsychological horror based on dental treatment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMultiple endings based on your choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbConversations with mysterious characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDark, cinematic original artwork</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982910?t=1757052048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/86424d1609aad91c8d05c7f41e04586d11214e1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757052048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/e1e1adee8c1a142a4ad65e47b1f0ba83f62c12da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757052048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/e1e1adee8c1a142a4ad65e47b1f0ba83f62c12da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757052048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This work contains scenes of dental treatment, violence, emotional distress, and compulsive behavior. If you are uncomfortable with these scenes, please refrain from playing."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcStory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In 2010, 1% of the world's population possesses paranormal abilities. Dr. Scaler, who possesses the power of immortality, engages in brutal human experiments to research paranormal abilities. He does so without hesitation or fear. There's only one thing that scares this man: the never-ending nightmare of dental treatment. Scalar, who is so dedicated to thorough dental care, could never have predicted that this nightmare would become reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/972603328245fc2935375b7f658134fc.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcSimple Exploration System x Psychological Horror Themed on Dental Treatment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game features a simple 2D exploration system, with basic controls limited to movement and investigation (talking). Players control Dr. Scaler, exploring both the real world and the spiritual world to unravel the mysteries that plague his psyche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/de6c83e39c42ae23cfe6d702e5b521ff.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcMultiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story has three endings depending on the choices you make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Scaler possesses superhuman strength, yet his only weakness is dental work. Every choice he makes leads him on a journey to discover who he is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/109287f3e3fa089581179671f9f7bb4b.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bc Mysterious Characters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, he's not the only one with supernatural abilities. Even his trustworthy dentist likely harbors terrifying powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/extras/bf95d09e4d74a3e8994515fefc583a38.avif?t=1757052048\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will his choices save humanity or doom him? Watch as Dr. Scaler and humanity face their own fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCompletion Time: Approximately 3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCollect all endings: Approximately 3-5 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbScenario-driven exploration adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSimple and classic exploration system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPsychological horror based on dental treatment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMultiple endings based on your choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbConversations with mysterious characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDark, cinematic original artwork</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Daniel Macoto"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982910/2ad6125dcb48390bd5c7251befcd20af3e5ed8ef/header.jpg?t=1757052048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highligh